<title>belgium: CYCLING-LEADING PLACINGS IN FLECHE WALLONNE RACE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-LEADING PLACINGS IN FLECHE WALLONNE RACE.</headline>
<dateline>HUY, Belgium 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in the</p>
<p>200.5-km Fleche Wallonne cycling race on Wednesday:</p>
<p>  1. Laurent Jalabert (France) Once	 5 hours 7 mins 0 secs</p>
<p>  2. Luc Leblanc (France) Polti	     19 seconds behind</p>
<p>  3. Alex Zuelle (Switzerland) Once	 50 seconds</p>
<p>4. Michele Bartoli (Italy) MG Technogym</p>
<p>5. Marco Pantani (Italy) Mercantone-Uno</p>
<p>6. Pascal Lino (France) Big Mat Auber</p>
<p>7. Andrea Noe (Italy) Asics</p>
<p>8. Beat Zberg (Switzerland) Mercantone-Uno</p>
<p>9. Benoit Salmon (France) Lotto</p>
<p>10. Richard Virenque (France) Festina</p>
<p>11. Mauro Gianetti (Switzerland) Francaise des Jeux</p>
<p>12. Jean-Cyril Robin (France) US Postal Service</p>
<p>13. Jens Heppner (Germany) Telekom</p>
<p>14. Michael Boogerd (Netherlands) Rabobank</p>
<p>15. Rafael Diaz Justo (Spain) Once</p>
<p>16. Erik Breukink (Netherlands) Rabobank</p>
<p>17. Maarten den Bakker (Netherlands) TVM</p>
<p>18. Enrico Zaina (Italy) Asics</p>
<p>19. Evgueni Berzin (Russia) Batik-Del Monte</p>
<p> 20. Bjarne Riis (Denmark) Telekom	 all same time as Zuelle</p>
